Package: revlitquery
Type: Package
Title: Reverse Literature Review Search Query Optimizer for PubMed and Google Scholar
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pascal", "Crepey", email = "crepey@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discovers and optimizes semantically equivalent PubMed and Google
    Scholar (<= 256 characters) search queries from a seed corpus of BibTeX
    references. Combines morphological prefix wildcard synthesis, PICO concept
    block discovery, timeline-stratified exclusion concept mining, and live
    NCBI E-utilities evaluation across the sensitivity-specificity Pareto
    frontier. Includes an interactive Shiny dashboard and CLI runner.
